option.WATER_CHOPPINESS=Choppiness
option.WATER_CHOPPINESS.comment=Sharpens the wave crests and flattens the troughs. Applies to all water, on top of the sea / lake / river choppiness
option.WATER_SEA_WAVE_HEIGHT=Sea Wave Height
option.WATER_SEA_WAVE_HEIGHT.comment=Multiplier on the height of sea waves. 0: flat
option.WATER_LAKE_WAVE_HEIGHT=Lake Wave Height
option.WATER_LAKE_WAVE_HEIGHT.comment=Multiplier on the height of waves on lakes and ponds. 0: flat
option.WATER_RIVER_WAVE_HEIGHT=River Wave Height
option.WATER_RIVER_WAVE_HEIGHT.comment=Multiplier on the height of river waves. 0: flat
option.WATER_SEA_CHOPPINESS=Sea Choppiness
option.WATER_SEA_CHOPPINESS.comment=Multiplier on how sharp the sea wave crests are
option.WATER_LAKE_CHOPPINESS=Lake Choppiness
option.WATER_LAKE_CHOPPINESS.comment=Multiplier on how sharp the lake wave crests are
option.WATER_RIVER_CHOPPINESS=River Choppiness
option.WATER_RIVER_CHOPPINESS.comment=Multiplier on how sharp the river wave crests are
option.WATER_LAKE_REFLECT_SCATTER=Lake Reflection Blur
option.WATER_LAKE_REFLECT_SCATTER.comment=How much waves smaller than a pixel blur reflections on lakes and ponds. 0: a mirror, so the far shore shows up sharp even when zoomed in. Needs Reflections set to SSR + Rough or higher
option.WATER_RIVER_REFLECT_SCATTER=River Reflection Blur
option.WATER_RIVER_REFLECT_SCATTER.comment=How much waves smaller than a pixel blur reflections on rivers. 0: a mirror. Needs Reflections set to SSR + Rough or higher
option.WATER_LAKE_TYPE=Lake Water Color
value.WATER_LAKE_TYPE.0=Open Ocean (Blue)
value.WATER_LAKE_TYPE.1=Coastal (Green)
value.WATER_LAKE_TYPE.2=Clear
option.WATER_LAKE_TYPE.comment=Absorption and scattering of lake water. Affects both the view through the surface and the underwater fog
option.WATER_RIVER_TYPE=River Water Color
value.WATER_RIVER_TYPE.0=Open Ocean (Blue)
value.WATER_RIVER_TYPE.1=Coastal (Green)
value.WATER_RIVER_TYPE.2=Clear
