option.DOF_FOCUS_GLASS.comment=Autofocus lands on the surface of glass, stained glass, ice, slime and honey. OFF ignores clear things in front and focuses on what is behind. ON blurs the view through a window. Clear glass is found through the voxels, so only glass within about 48 blocks counts
option.DOF_FOCUS_WATER=Focus on Water Surface
option.DOF_FOCUS_WATER.comment=Autofocus lands on the water surface when seen from outside the water. OFF focuses through the surface on the bottom or what is behind, so the surface and its reflections blur. Seen from underwater it always focuses behind
