value.LENS_FISHEYE_FIT.1=Fit Width
option.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA=Build Distortion In TAA
option.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA.comment=Where the fisheye / distortion image is built. Final stretches the finished image, so the fisheye center (magnified about 2.5x at FOV 110) looks soft. TAA builds it from the jittered frames, so the center regains fine detail while standing still or turning slowly (fast motion looks like Final). Costs about the same as Final. Auto = TAA for the fisheye and strong distortion. Needs TAA
